ast Coast tree huggers appreciate bears up close and personal.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6987179266077521702/comments/default/9218652522892092494'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6987179266077521702/comments/default/9218652522892092494'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/08/persecution-of-jeremy-hill.html?showComment=1314893237235#c9218652522892092494' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/08/persecution-of-jeremy-hill.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6987179266077521702' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6987179266077521702' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1620274646"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2011 at 10:07 AM"/></entry></feed>